    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels different. like i saw things that most people can't even imagine, and now i'm back here and nothing matters. the jobs, the small talk, the way people worry about nothing... it's all so shallow. i feel like i've already left, you know? like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up with where my head is.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
